{"id":1690,"date":"2026-08-24T04:30:45","date_gmt":"2026-08-24T04:30:45","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1690"},"modified":"2026-08-24T05:50:43","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T05:50:43","slug":"pack-go","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/export-share\/pack-go\/","title":{"rendered":"Pack &#038; Go"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Pack &amp; Go<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1704\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PackAndGoTheSecond.webp\" alt=\"Pack &amp; Go\" width=\"149\" height=\"153\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PackAndGoTheSecond.webp 919w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PackAndGoTheSecond-292x300.webp 292w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PackAndGoTheSecond-768x789.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 149px) 100vw, 149px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Pack &amp; Go is Open Publisher&#8217;s professional handoff tool for commercial print shops. When you send a document to a printer, they need more than just the file &#8211; they need all embedded images as standard image files and a list of every font used. Pack &amp; Go bundles everything into a single <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.zip<\/span> folder that any printer can open and work with immediately, saving you the time and risk of manually locating and packaging assets yourself.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How to Use Pack &amp; Go<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1693\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-052940.png\" alt=\"How to Use Pack &amp; Go\" width=\"482\" height=\"319\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-052940.png 1426w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-052940-300x199.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-052940-1024x678.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-052940-768x508.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 482px) 100vw, 482px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>File &gt; Export &gt; Pack &amp; Go<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Open Publisher runs an intelligent client-side algorithm that automatically prepares all your assets.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.zip<\/span> file is compiled and downloaded to your computer.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Hand the single <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.zip<\/span> file to your commercial printer &#8211; they have everything they need to open, edit, and print your document.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">What Pack &amp; Go Includes<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Pack &amp; Go algorithm performs the following steps automatically:<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1697\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PackAndGo.webp\" alt=\"What Pack &amp; Go Includes\" width=\"448\" height=\"316\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PackAndGo.webp 670w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PackAndGo-300x212.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 448px) 100vw, 448px\" \/><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Image extraction &#8211;<\/strong> Scans your entire <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.opub<\/span> file for all embedded Base64 image strings, extracts the raw binary data of every graphic, and converts them into standard image files (for example: <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">image_1.jpeg<\/span>, <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">image_2.png<\/span>), organised neatly inside an <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">Images\/<\/span> folder.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Link rewriting &#8211;<\/strong> Rewrites the <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.opub<\/span> project file&#8217;s internal image links to reference the newly extracted image files, so everything remains correctly connected.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Font manifest &#8211;<\/strong> Performs a deep scan of every <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">font-family<\/span> declaration across all elements and pages, compiles a definitive list, and generates a <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">Fonts.txt<\/span> manifest. This tells the print shop exactly which Google Fonts need to be installed to reproduce your document&#8217;s typography faithfully.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Compression &#8211;<\/strong> Compresses the project file, all extracted images, and the font manifest into a single <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.zip<\/span> file and downloads it automatically.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Privacy<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1701\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OP_PackAndGo.webp\" alt=\"Privacy\" width=\"138\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OP_PackAndGo.webp 448w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OP_PackAndGo-293x300.webp 293w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 138px) 100vw, 138px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The entire Pack &amp; Go process happens natively in your browser using the open-source <strong>JSZip<\/strong> library. Your documents and images are <strong>never uploaded to any external server<\/strong> &#8211; all processing takes place locally on your machine.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Pack &amp; Go Pack &amp; Go is Open Publisher&#8217;s professional handoff tool for commercial print shops. When you send a document to a printer, they need more than just the file &#8211; they need all embedded images as standard image files and a list of every font used. Pack &amp; Go bundles everything into a [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1704,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[21],"class_list":["post-1690","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-export-share"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1690","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1690"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1690\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1706,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1690\/revisions\/1706"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1704"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1690"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1690"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}